     1,
     "Apologies for any cross-posting:<div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Dear colleagues, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">On behalf of local organizers Artur Pokropek and colleagues, we are pleased to announce that the next Meeting of the SEM Working Group will take place in Warsaw from 15-17 April 2026. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">At a glance: </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Calibri;font-size:16px;margin-top:0cm\"><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Prof. Yves Rosseel (Ghent University) has once again graciously agreed to offer a pre-conference workshop on 15 April </span></li><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">The Meeting proper will take place from 16-17 April in Warsaw, Poland</span></li><li style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">The Meeting will be hosted by Educational Research Institute – National Research Institute (IBE) and the Institute of Philosophy and Sociology, Polish Academy of Sciences (IFiS PAN)</span></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">More details (programme, venue, registration) as well as the Call for Papers will follow soon. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">If you know other colleagues who may be interested in the 2026 meeting, send them to this site: <a href=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tu-chemnitz.de%2Fhsw%2Fsoziologie%2FProfessuren%2FEmpirische_Sozialforschung%2FSEM%2Fnews.php&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7C9add42bc0ced43808b7108ddefa10678%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638930197063493212%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=k4mc6Z%2F3OryRk99sbl3fB8VBId4yBp3ajYpNevVuIxA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL:\nhttps://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/news.php\n\nClick to follow link.\" style=\"text-decoration-line:underline;color:rgb(149,79,114)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fwww.tu-chemnitz.de%252Fhsw%252Fsoziologie%252FProfessuren%252FEmpirische_Sozialforschung%252FSEM%252Fnews.php%26data%3D05%257C02%257Ct.d.jorgensen%2540uva.nl%257C9add42bc0ced43808b7108ddefa10678%257Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%257C0%257C0%257C638930197063493212%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3Dk4mc6Z%252F3OryRk99sbl3fB8VBId4yBp3ajYpNevVuIxA%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462675338000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dQQxDMFtmE1bknZYaBptj\">https://www.tu-chemnitz.de/hsw/soziologie/Professuren/Empirische_Sozialforschung/SEM/news.php</a>to sign up for the newsletter. </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Kind regards, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">on behalf of Artur and colleagues in Poland, </span></p><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:11pt;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span lang=\"EN-CA\">Henrik</span></p><br></div>"
